# Garenbrig Growth (CR 715.4, 608.2b): when its only target is gone as it would resolve it is countered on resolution and does not
# resolve, so it is put into its owner's graveyard, not exiled on an adventure: Virtue of Strength can no longer be cast later.
# Turn 3 Bot1 targets the Grizzly Bears in its graveyard; Bot2 answers with Tormod's Crypt, exiling that graveyard.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Emerald
Virtue of Strength
Faithless Looting
Grizzly Bears
Forest
Black Lotus
Mox Jet
Mox Sapphire
Mox Pearl
Forest x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Tormod's Crypt
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Faithless Looting.Cast
Bot1.Choose(Grizzly Bears; Forest)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Tormod's Crypt.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Virtue of Strength.Cast(Ability: Garenbrig Growth; Bot1.Graveyard.Grizzly Bears)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Battlefield.Tormod's Crypt.Activate(Bot1)
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass

[Expect]
Exile = Faithless Looting; Forest; Grizzly Bears
Bot1.Graveyard = Virtue of Strength
